    "description": "Beta-sesquiphellandrene is a sesquiterpene that is cyclohexene in which the hydrogens at position 6 are replaced by a methylidene group and in which the pro-R hydrogen at position 3 is replaced by a (2S)-6-methylhept-5-en-2-yl group. It has a role as a plant metabolite. It is an alicyclic compound and a sesquiterpene.",
